    "gitCommitMessage": "Add jive-abstract-app-expo: build and deploy Expo apps per environment\n\nAn Expo app extending this abstract gets Jive's six CI/CD hooks with no pipeline code: build exports the web\napp once per environment with that environment's EXPO_PUBLIC_ variables, deploy publishes it to EAS Hosting\n(production, an alias, or a per-commit preview deployment) at the URL deploy:url predicted, then starts an EAS\nBuild for each native platform when none exists for the runtime version and publishes an EAS Update to the\nenvironment's channel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
